{"title":"改革！两大法规重要修改","date":"2017-09-04","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">改革！两大法规重要修改</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"editor\">\r\n\t<section style=\"margin:5px 0;\">\r\n\t\t<section class=\"96wx-bdc\" style=\"width: 100%; border-left-style: solid; border-left-width: 0.4em; border-color: rgb(89, 195, 249); padding: 1em;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 32px; line-height: 32px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 19px; font-family: 宋体;\">按照党中央、国务院要求，为深化招标投标领域&ldquo;放管服&rdquo;改革，不断增强招标投标制度的适用性和前瞻性，推动政府职能转变，助力供给侧结构性改革，促进经济社会持续健康发展，起草形成了《关于修改〈招标投标法〉〈招标投标法实施条例〉的决定》（征求意见稿）。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:宋体;color:#3E3E3E;background:#FAFAFA\">​其中，</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:宋体;color:#FF4C41;background:#FAFAFA\">《招标投标法》共有8项内容进行了修改，《招标投标法实施条例》共有2项内容进行了修改</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:宋体;color:#3E3E3E;background:#FAFAFA\">。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-top: 0px; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"width: 0.38em; overflow: hidden; margin-top: -3em; float: left;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"96wx-bgc\" style=\"height: 1em; width: 0.4em; background-color: rgb(89, 195, 249);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"96wx-bdlc\" style=\"width: 0px; height: 0px; border-style: solid; border-width: 0px 0.3em 0.3em 0.4em; border-color: transparent transparent transparent rgb(89, 195, 249);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"96wx-bgc\" style=\"height: 0.5em; width: 0.4em; opacity: 0.8; margin-top: 0.2em; transform: skewY(-30deg); background-color: rgb(89, 195, 249);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"96wx-bgc\" style=\"height: 0.5em; width: 0.4em; opacity: 0.5; margin-top: 0.2em; transform: skewY(-30deg); background-color: rgb(89, 195, 249);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"96wx-bgc\" style=\"height: 0.5em; width: 0.4em; margin-top: 0.2em; opacity: 0.3; transform: skewY(-30deg); background-color: rgb(89, 195, 249);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201709/%E4%B8%80.png\" style=\"width: 666px; height: 694px;\" /></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">关于修改《招标投标法》的决定<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">（征求意见稿）</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#3E3E3E;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">一、将第三条中的<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>国务院发展计划部门<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>修改为<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>国务院发展改革部门<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#3E3E3E;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">二、第五条增加一款，作为第二款：<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:red;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">国家鼓励利用信息网络进行电子招标投标。数据电文形式与纸质形式的招标投标活动具有同等法律效力。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#3E3E3E;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&rdquo;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#3E3E3E;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">三、删去第十三条第二款第三项。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#3E3E3E;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">四、将第十九条第二款修改为：<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>国家对招标项目的技术、标准有规定的，招标人应当按照其规定在招标文件中提出相应要求。招标人可以在招标文件中合理设置支持技术创新、节能环保等方面的要求和条件。<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#3E3E3E;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">五、将第二十四条修改为：<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>招标人应当确定投标人编制投标文件所需要的合理时间；但是，依法必须进行招标的项目，自招标文件开始发出之日起至投标人提交投标文件截止之日止，最短不得少于二十日，</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:red;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">采用电子招标投标在线提交投标文件的，最短不得少于十日</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#3E3E3E;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">。<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#3E3E3E;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">六、第四十一条增加一款，作为第二款：<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>前款第二项中标条件适用于具有通用技术、性能标准或者招标人对其技术、性能没有特殊要求的招标项目。<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#3E3E3E;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">七、将第四十七条修改为：<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>依法必须进行招标的项目，招标人应当自订立书面合同之日起十五日内，向有关行政监督部门提交招标投标和合同订立情况的书面报告及合同副本。<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#3E3E3E;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">八、第四十八条增加一款，作为第四款：<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>依法必须进行招标的项目，招标人和中标人应当公布合同履行情况。<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#3E3E3E;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"editor\">\r\n\t<section class=\"96wx-bdc\" style=\"line-height: 30px; border: 2px solid rgb(95, 170, 255); border-radius: 0.8em; font-family: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; text-decoration: inherit; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"padding:10px;box-sizing:border-box\">\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"96wx-bgc\" style=\"width: 0.5em; height: 0.5em; float: left; border-radius: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(95, 170, 255);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"96wx-bgc\" style=\"width: 0.5em; height: 0.5em; float: right; border-radius: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(95, 170, 255);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"padding-right:20px;padding-left:20px;box-sizing:border-box\">\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"96wx-color\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(95, 170, 255);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:28px\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 32px; line-height: 28px; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:宋体;color:red\">从《招标投标法》草案修改的内容可以明显看出，电子招标投标的法律地位进一步提高。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 32px; line-height: 28px; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:宋体;color:red\">此外，修改后的第二十四条中明确：&ldquo;<strong>采用电子招标投标在线提交投标文件的，最短不得少于十日。</strong>&rdquo;这一条是对发展电子招投标的有力支持。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: left; margin-bottom: 10px; text-indent: 2em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:19px;font-family:宋体;color:red\">​也就是说，对于依法必须进行招标的项目，采用电子招标投标在线提交投标文件的，最多<strong>可节省10天的招标周期，可以有效缩短招标周期，有利于实现降本增效。</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent:32px;line-height:28px\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"padding:10px;box-sizing:border-box\">\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"96wx-bgc\" style=\"width: 0.5em; height: 0.5em; float: left; border-radius: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(95, 170, 255);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"96wx-bgc\" style=\"width: 0.5em; height: 0.5em; float: right; border-radius: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(95, 170, 255);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"clear:both;box-sizing:border-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">关于修改《招标投标法实施条例》的决定<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">（征求意见稿）</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 7.5pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#3E3E3E;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">一、将第五十五条修改为：<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>招标人根据评标委员会提出的书面评标报告和推荐的中标候选人确定中标人。招标人也可以授权评标委员会直接确定中标人，或者在招标文件中规定排名第一的中标候选人为中标人，并明确排名第一的中标候选人不能作为中标人的 情形和相关处理规则。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nHelvetica;color:#3E3E3E;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">依法必须进行招标的项目，</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:red;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">招标人根据评标委员会提出的书面评标报告和推荐的中标候选人自行确定中标人的，应当在向有关行政监督部门提交的招标投标情况书面报告中，说明其确定中标人的理由</span><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#3E3E3E;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">。</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#3E3E3E;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&rdquo;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt; text-align: center; line-height: 26px;\">二、第五十九条增加一款，作为第四款：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt; text-align: center; line-height: 26px;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt; text-align: center; line-height: 26px;\">依法必须进行招标的项目，招标人和中标人应当公布合同履行情况。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt; text-align: center; line-height: 26px;\">&rdquo;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"editor\">\r\n\t<section class=\"96wx-bdc\" style=\"line-height: 30px; border: 2px solid rgb(95, 170, 255); border-radius: 0.8em; font-family: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; text-decoration: inherit; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"padding:10px;box-sizing:border-box\">\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"96wx-bgc\" style=\"width: 0.5em; height: 0.5em; float: left; border-radius: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(95, 170, 255);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"96wx-bgc\" style=\"width: 0.5em; height: 0.5em; float: right; border-radius: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(95, 170, 255);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"clear:both;box-sizing:border-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"padding-right:20px;padding-left:20px;box-sizing:border-box\">\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(95, 170, 255); text-align: left; text-indent: 2em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 华文中宋; color: red;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px; font-family: 宋体;\">《招标投标法实施条例》修改草案中最大的变动就是，第五十五条修改之后<strong>招标人可以自行确定中标人</strong>，不必受排名第一的约束，<strong>即使是依法必须招标的项目，招标人也可以在推荐的中标候选人中自行确定中标人，只要说明确定的理由即可，</strong>这是对招标人的极大放权。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"padding:10px;box-sizing:border-box\">\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"96wx-bgc\" style=\"width: 0.5em; height: 0.5em; float: left; border-radius: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(95, 170, 255);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"96wx-bgc\" style=\"width: 0.5em; height: 0.5em; float: right; border-radius: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(95, 170, 255);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"clear:both;box-sizing:border-box\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"editor\">\r\n\t<section style=\"margin: 5px 0;text-align:center;\">\r\n\t\t<section class=\"96wx-bdbc\" style=\"font-size: 1.3em; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-color: rgb(233, 71, 15); padding: 0px 0px 5px; margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: -10px; margin-right: 20px; border-top-color: rgb(15, 81, 233);\">\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"fontcolor-changeable\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 5px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:华文中宋;color:#3E3E3E\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">《招标投标法》及其实施条例修改前后对照表</span></strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section class=\"96wx-bdtc\" style=\"display: inline-block; margin-left: -15px; border-left-width: 5px; border-left-style: solid; border-color: rgb(233, 71, 15) transparent rgb(15, 81, 233); border-right-width: 5px; border-right-style: solid; border-top-width: 10px; border-top-style: solid;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201709/0_1.jpg\" style=\"width: 793px; height: 1122px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201709/0_2.jpg\" style=\"width: 793px; height: 1122px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201709/0_3.jpg\" style=\"width: 793px; height: 1122px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201709/0_4.jpg\" style=\"width: 793px; height: 1122px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201709/0_5.jpg\" style=\"width: 793px; height: 1122px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201709/0_6.jpg\" style=\"width: 793px; height: 1122px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201709/0_7.jpg\" style=\"width: 793px; height: 1122px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201709/0_8.jpg\" style=\"width: 793px; height: 1122px;\" /></p>"}